<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Culligan raised to buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Culligan raised to buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Smith Barney analyst Leone Young raised the rating on Culligan Water Technologies Inc to buy from outperform, her office said.</p>
<p>-- shares closed at 40 on Tuesday.</p>
</text>
